      <title>Boris Johnson and David Cameron Are as Wrong as Ever About Brexit</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-18/boris-johnson-and-david-cameron-are-as-wrong-as-ever-about-brexit</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">96fee386858e27b6cb160193</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 07:00:20 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>If you wanted advice on improving Britain’s ties with the European Union, you couldn’t find a pair less qualified than ex-Conservative prime ministers David Cameron and Boris Johnson. The former recklessly called the Brexit referendum to quell discontent within his party, then lost it. The latter crashed Britain out of the EU on the worst terms possible.</description>
